{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop on your broom and start a magical adventure! \u300aEnchanted Broom\u300b is a 3D platformer filled with magic and exploration. Play as a cute little witch, jump and fly through a vibrant, colorful world, collect scattered magical crystals, and restore the world's balance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming &amp; Exploration</strong>: Use your agile moves to jump and navigate through complex terrain, and discover hidden paths and easter eggs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Broom Flight</strong>: Fly freely on your broom, avoid obstacles, or reach areas that are hard to get to with regular jumps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat &amp; Puzzles</strong>: Throw your spinning broom to fend off enemies, use environmental mechanics to solve puzzles, and unlock new areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collection &amp; Progression</strong>: Collect crystals to unlock new skills and broom skins, and strengthen your character's abilities</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994200?t=1762140960","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994200/68f786d769096a5426df74363c3d8f89db3b741c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762140960","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994200/ce7e7b9bb05369c2bf9e3fd8e024aeee0e83da78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762140960","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994200/ce7e7b9bb05369c2bf9e3fd8e024aeee0e83da78/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762140960","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4133690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop on your broom and start a magical adventure! \u300aEnchanted Broom\u300b is a 3D platformer filled with magic and exploration. Play as a cute little witch, jump and fly through a vibrant, colorful world, collect scattered magical crystals, and restore the world's balance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming &amp; Exploration</strong>: Use your agile moves to jump and navigate through complex terrain, and discover hidden paths and easter eggs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Broom Flight</strong>: Fly freely on your broom, avoid obstacles, or reach areas that are hard to get to with regular jumps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat &amp; Puzzles</strong>: Throw your spinning broom to fend off enemies, use environmental mechanics to solve puzzles, and unlock new areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collection &amp; Progression</strong>: Collect crystals to unlock new skills and broom skins, and strengthen your character's abilities</p>","developers":["DimSumForge"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994200/6290034509ca65571c2bfa11d2cf498c7242f897/header.jpg?t=1762140960","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3994200/24435152/d158b9ffa55a3c0e4d6e89c8437d7bba0002cdb7/1761928745/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761969361","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3994200/24435152/d158b9ffa55a3c0e4d6e89c8437d7bba0002cdb7/1761928745/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761969361","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3994200/24435152/d158b9ffa55a3c0e4d6e89c8437d7bba0002cdb7/1761928745/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761969361","id":257217102,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257217102/movie480.mp4?t=1761969361","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257217102/movie_max.